{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 10, :comments ["<b>And repays those who hate Him to His face.</b> That is, to those who are His enemies He repays the recompense of their handiwork immediately, and does not delay for the one who hates Him. Therefore: ״ושמרת את החקים״ etc., and ״והיה עקב תשמעון״ — that is, if you do thus and keep, then ״ושמר ה' אלהיך לך״ — immediately, ״את הברית ואת החסד״ — He will not wait for a thousand, but to you He will repay this good recompense, for the one who is first to heed the commandments will be zealous and rewarded."], :book :deuteronomy, :voice :daat-zkenim, :lang :en, :chapter 7, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T13:00:33.901494487Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}